<title>USA: USX to redeem 7 percent subordinated debt due 2017.</title>
<headline>USX to redeem 7 percent subordinated debt due 2017.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USX Corp said it will redeem all of its outstanding seven percent convertible subordinated debentures due 2017, on April 15.</p>
<p>About $227 million aggregate principal amount of these debentures is currently outstanding. They are being redeemed at a price of $50.35 per $50 principal amount plus accrued interest to the redemption date, USX said.</p>
</text>
